<title>NETHERLANDS: GIST-BROCADES ACQUIRES BRAZILIAN FIRM.</title>
<headline>GIST-BROCADES ACQUIRES BRAZILIAN FIRM.</headline>
<dateline>DELFT, Netherlands 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch biochemicals and food group Gist-Brocades NV said on Monday it acquired bread improvers group Colombo Industrie e Commercio in Sao Paulo, Brazil.  </p>
<p>&quot;By the deal, Gist-brocades takes over production facilities from Colombo Industria e Comercio as well as products, formulations, brand names and relevant market shares,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>Turnover amounts to about $8.5 million, and the company employs 95 people.</p>
<p>No financial details were given on the deal.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom + 31 20 504 5000</p>
